OL,3,GNEWSAWinter support planned for
OL,4,Avulnerable residents
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Surrey council is poised to set aside
OL,7,F#150,000 to support its most vulnerable
OL,8,Fresidents through the winter months.
OL,10,FTandridge District Council plans to run
OL,11,Fits winter support scheme for another
OL,12,Fyear, giving eligible residents money
OL,13,Fto help with essentials and bills.
OL,15,FCouncillors on the strategy and
OL,16,Fresources committee are due to consider
OL,17,Fthe proposals this week, according to
OL,18,Fthe Local Democracy Reporting Service.
OL,20,F"Each past scheme has helped nearly 500
OL,21,Fhouseholds," a report issued ahead of
OL,22,FThursday's meeting says.
OL,23,APub: 22-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
